%% 13 · S7 SSE 事件序列与前端消费
%% 主线：progress / result / error 三种事件 → StepRail / ResultTable / ErrorCard
%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"noteBkgColor": "#f9fafb", "noteBorderColor": "#6b7280", "noteTextColor": "#374151"}, "sequence": {"actorMargin": 45, "width": 130, "messageMargin": 32, "boxMargin": 8, "noteMargin": 8, "mirrorActors": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AR as AgentRunner
    participant SS as SSE
    participant BR as Browser
    participant SR as StepRail
    participant RT as ResultTable
    participant EC as ErrorCard

    AR->>SS: progress(step, running)
    SS->>BR: data: {"type":"progress",...}
    BR->>SR: 执行中（spinner）
    AR->>SS: progress(step, success, duration_ms)
    SS->>BR: data: {"type":"progress",...}
    BR->>SR: ✓ + 耗时
    AR->>SS: progress(correct_sql, skipped)
    SS->>BR: data: {"type":"progress",...}
    BR->>SR: 未触发 –（不是灰色 pending）

    alt result
        AR->>SS: result(columns, rows)
        SS->>BR: data: {"type":"result",...}
        BR->>RT: 按列类型渲染
        Note over RT: rows=[] 时给空态块，不画表头
    else error class=failure
        AR->>SS: error(code, class=failure, step)
        SS->>BR: data: {"type":"error",...}
        BR->>SR: 当前 running 步骤标 ×
        BR->>EC: 红框 + 可复制细节
    else error class=empty
        AR->>SS: error(EMPTY_RESULT, class=empty)
        SS->>BR: data: {"type":"error",...}
        BR->>SR: 步骤保持 ✓，不标红
        BR->>EC: 虚线空态卡
    else error class=cancelled
        AR->>SS: error(CANCELLED, class=cancelled)
        SS->>BR: data: {"type":"error",...}
        BR->>SR: running 步骤标 ⊘ 已取消
        BR->>EC: 中性卡，不算 done
    end

    opt 客户端断开
        BR->>BR: AbortController.abort()
        BR->>SR: 本地直接置 cancelled
        Note over AR,BR: FastAPI finally 里 cancel + release
    end
